00:11:47.087 --> 00:11:49.387
contemplating suicide

00:11:49.387 --> 00:11:53.044
and I found a passion and a hobby.

00:11:53.044 --> 00:11:55.178
And I pursued it with blinders

00:11:55.178 --> 00:11:56.504
and anyone that didn't like it

00:11:56.504 --> 00:11:58.078
could kiss my entire ass.

00:11:58.078 --> 00:12:00.803
(cheering)

00:12:00.803 --> 00:12:03.019
And they still can.

00:12:03.019 --> 00:12:05.137
(cheering)

00:12:05.137 --> 00:12:08.138
So take my strength, take my heart,

00:12:08.138 --> 00:12:10.534
take everyone in here's strength

00:12:10.534 --> 00:12:14.025
and just keep the fight alive, keep going.

